"Turn On Blocked Request Count?" = "要打开已拦截请求数吗？";
"Turn On" = "打开";
"Safari doesn't tell extensions what content blockers block. To get a count, wBlock copies the filter rules that block one domain or a path on it (like ||example.com^ or ||example.com/ads/) into Safari's declarativeNetRequest engine, and Safari counts how often they match. Rules that can match any domain or only apply on certain sites aren't counted, and neither are hidden page elements. Safari also limits how many rules an extension can have, so with many filter lists some are left out. Blocking doesn't change, but the number will probably be a lot lower than you're used to. It counts requests, so a tracker that loads five times counts as five." = "Safari 不会告诉扩展内容拦截器拦截了什么。为了得到数量，wBlock 会把拦截某个域名或其上某个路径的过滤规则（例如 ||example.com^ 或 ||example.com/ads/）复制到 Safari 的 declarativeNetRequest 引擎中，由 Safari 统计它们的匹配次数。可能匹配任意域名、或只在特定网站生效的规则不会被统计，隐藏的页面元素也不会。Safari 还限制了一个扩展能拥有的规则数量，所以过滤列表较多时会有一部分被舍弃。拦截效果不变，但这个数字很可能比你习惯的低很多。统计的是请求次数，所以一个加载了五次的跟踪器会计为五次。";
