/* 4.0 upgrade notice */
"Welcome to wBlock 4.0" = "欢迎使用 wBlock 4.0";
"Got It" = "好";
"Why things changed" = "为什么会有这些改变";
"wBlock used AdGuard's converter to turn filter lists into Safari rules. It skips rules written only for uBlock Origin. That meant many uBO lists didn't work fully in wBlock." = "wBlock 过去使用 AdGuard 的转换器，把过滤列表转换为 Safari 规则。转换器会跳过只为 uBlock Origin 编写的规则，所以很多 uBO 列表在 wBlock 中无法完整生效。";
"A new engine" = "全新引擎";
"I built a new engine that reads lists like uBlock Origin. wBlock starts from uBO's lists now. Your enabled AdGuard lists were swapped for matching uBO lists." = "我开发了一个新引擎，可以像 uBlock Origin 一样读取列表。wBlock 现在以 uBO 的列表为起点。你启用的 AdGuard 列表已被替换为对应的 uBO 列表。";
"What stays the same" = "保持不变的内容";
"Your custom lists, userscripts, Element Zapper rules and site settings are unchanged. AdGuard lists are still in Filters if you want them back." = "你的自定义列表、用户脚本、Element Zapper 规则和网站设置都没有改变。如果你想换回 AdGuard 列表，它们仍在“过滤器”中。";
"If a site breaks" = "如果网站出现问题";
"Turn wBlock off for that site using the wBlock button in Safari. Then let me know on [GitHub](https://github.com/0xCUB3/wBlock/issues)." = "在 Safari 中点按 wBlock 按钮，为该网站关闭 wBlock。然后请在 [GitHub](https://github.com/0xCUB3/wBlock/issues) 上告诉我。";
"Duplicate Filter Lists" = "重复的过滤列表";
"Remove Copy" = "移除副本";
"Keep Both" = "全部保留";
"\"%@\" has almost the same rules as \"%@\", so wBlock is applying them twice. Remove the copy?" = "“%1$@”与“%2$@”的规则几乎相同，因此 wBlock 会重复应用这些规则。要移除副本吗？";
